A BILL
for
1 AN ACT relating to the administration of the government;
2 specifying requirements and limitations for supplemental
3 budget requests; repealing a provision regarding the
4 preparation of alternative budgets; making conforming
5 amendments; and providing for an effective date.
6
7 Be It Enacted by the Legislature of the State of Wyoming:
8
9 Section 1. W.S. 9-2-1013(d) by creating a new
10 paragraph (vii) is amended to read:
11
12 9-2-1013. State budget; distribution of copies to
13 legislators; copies and reports of authorizations;
14 interfund loans.
