1 SF0180

2025 STATE OF WYOMING 25LSO-0437
1 (d) In addition to the items contained in subsection
2 (a) of this section and notwithstanding any other
3 recommendations made by the governor, the state budget
4 shall also include the governor's recommendations for
5 appropriations for the ensuing two (2) years, or if a
6 supplemental budget, request, the remainder of the budget
7 period, subject to the following:
8
9 (vii) Any recommendations in a supplemental
10 budget from the governor or agencies shall be limited to
11 the following recommendations for amendments to the state
12 budget:
13
14 (A) Necessary reductions occasioned by the
15 most recent published consensus revenue estimating group
16 estimate of revenue shortfalls;
17
18 (B) Appropriations necessitated by human or
19 natural disasters;
20
21 (C) Appropriations necessitated by public
22 welfare emergencies as defined by W.S. 9-2-1002(a)(xxv) for
2 SF0180

