1 which amounts appropriated for public welfare emergencies
2 under W.S. 9-2-1014.3 are insufficient;
3
4 (D) Recommendations regarding increases or
5 decreases to savings;
6
7 (E) Necessary personnel adjustments.
8
9 Section 2. W.S. 9-2-1013(d)(vi) is repealed.
10
11 Section 3. This act is effective July 1, 2025.
